cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "quantum-aimd: Quantum-Centric Ab Initio Molecular Dynamics with SQD"
abstract: "Ab initio molecular dynamics driven by sample-based quantum
  diagonalization (SQD). Couples QUICK/AMBER QM/MM trajectories to PySCF
  Hamiltonians, LUCJ circuits executed on IBM Quantum hardware, and S-CORE
  selected-CI energies and gradients."

